WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.199
Japan and South Korea

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.399
are 2 very modern countries in Asia,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.819
but there's a lot of differences.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.339
Here are 3 of them.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.939
Number one technology.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.319
Of course, South Korea is very innovative,

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.059
but Japan takes innovation to the next level.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.466
Robots are serving you food,

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.186
toilets are checking your blood pressure,

00:00:17.187 --> 00:00:19.946
and vending machines are selling anything under the sun.

00:00:19.947 --> 00:00:21.199
So if you don't want anyone next to you

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.986
to hear your pooping sounds or bodily functions,

00:00:23.987 --> 00:00:25.746
you press this music button

00:00:25.747 --> 00:00:28.032
and a rainforest sound comes on. Watch me.

00:00:30.753 --> 00:00:32.072
Number 2 music.

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:33.992
If Japan beats Korea and technology,

00:00:33.993 --> 00:00:36.352
then Korea definitely wins in music.

00:00:36.353 --> 00:00:40.499
Korea is the home of BTS and all other things K pop.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.619
These K pop artists are training for years

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.859
so they can hit the stage with their best dance moves

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.939
to impress everybody in the country and the world.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.560
Seriously, K pop is madness.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.806
Number 3 food.

00:00:51.807 --> 00:00:53.486
Japanese food is very savory,

00:00:53.487 --> 00:00:55.446
while Korean dishes bring the heat.

00:00:55.447 --> 00:00:56.206
To be honest,

00:00:56.207 --> 00:00:58.806
both cuisine are my absolute favorite in the world.

00:00:58.807 --> 00:01:00.052
Which one do you prefer?
